    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Tie-out procedure",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Georgia",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1.  Foot every column of every source table and compare to the total the document prints.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#22262B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2.  Where a total does not foot, tie each line: quota less subscribed must equal unsubscribed.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#22262B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3.  Isolate the line, quantify the variance, decide materiality, disclose.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#22262B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Finding",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Georgia",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#9B2D20",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Enclosure D (Treasury, 25 Jan 1792) prints subscriptions totalling $18,328,186.21. The column sums to $17,798,186.21. Line-level tie-out isolates the whole $500,000 in North Carolina: quota $2,400,000 less printed subscribed $1,166,355.57 gives $1,233,644.43 unsubscribed, but the document prints $733,644.43. The reconciled figure $1,666,355.57 is used throughout.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#22262B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "After that correction the column is still $30,000 short of the printed total. A second line explains it: Massachusetts's over-subscription is printed as $477,013.81, but $4,447,013.81 subscribed less the $4,000,000 quota is $447,013.81. The Treasury carried the wrong line into its total. Reconciled total: $18,298,186.21. Maryland is $30 out - immaterial.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#22262B"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Both errors sit in single printed lines, not in the Treasury's arithmetic. Every other document ties.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#2F7D6D",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "6pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
